expression: out
---
Manage S3-compatible object storage configuration

Usage: qam s3 [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  set   Store S3 credentials and defaults in config
  test  Test S3 upload with a file
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --config <path>  Path to config file (default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/camsnap/config.yaml)
  -h, --help           Print help
